  No HashiCorp Vault (BUSL-1.1) or OpenBao source code, documentation text or
  test data is copied into this repository. The SDKs implement the documented
  HashiCorp Vault HTTP API (https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/api-docs)
  from scratch; their structure follows the Grow Codes OpenBao SDK
  (https://github.com/grow-codes-packages/openbao, Apache-2.0, same authors).

  The recorded HTTP responses used by the unit tests (*/fixtures/*.json,
  go/testdata/fixtures, rust/tests/fixtures) were recorded by Grow Codes from
  its own throw-away HashiCorp Vault 2.2.2 test server; tokens, secret ids,
  passwords and private keys were replaced by placeholders.

  The Docker integration suite pulls the unmodified upstream images
  hashicorp/vault (BUSL-1.1) and postgres (PostgreSQL License) at test time;
  they are not redistributed with the packages. docker/bootstrap/test-csr.pem
  is a certificate signing request generated by Grow Codes for tests only.
